            "subheading": "Versatile",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>This versatile material's warm palette makes it compliment muted tones perfectly, providing a touch of contrast and comfort to spaces that possess a high density of greys and whites.</p><p></p><p>Paulownia wood is equally at home in more rustic/traditional aesthetics, with its ability to seamlessly blend with tones similar to that of itself in order to create a coherent and cozy space.</p>",
