            "tab_label": "Item",
            "subheading": "Durable",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>Paulownia wood is uniquely strong for its weight, allowing for our mirrors to last a near limitless amount of time in your home.</p><p></p><p>In fact, we are so confident in the quality of our Paulownia wood, as with all of our products, we offer a 10 year warranty so that in the extremely rare scenario in which your mirror does sustain damage over time, William Wood has you covered.</p>",
