            "tab_label": "",
            "subheading": "Sustainable",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>To top it all off, Paulownia wood is one of the most sustainable wood types on the planet, posessing the ability to regrow directly from the stump.</p><p></p><p>This, combined with its high growth rate of up to 15 feet per season allows for it to recover from being harvested extremely quickly, supporting a highly diverse ecosystem of plants and animals during its regrowth.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
